{"instrument_id":"mn:al-fort-payne-2026","state_code":"AL","jurisdiction_name":"Fort Payne","jurisdiction_type":"City","scope":"multi_sector_data_centers","status":"active","severity_score":4,"technologies":["battery_storage"],"restriction_types":["moratorium"],"evidence_level":"compiled_flagged","verification":"unverified","source_family":"Moratorium Nation","date_enacted_iso":"2026-06-16","date_text":null,"current_end_date":null,"description":"Pause on data center development while the city drafts zoning rules; officials said the city had received no data center inquiry and acted before an application arrived. Active as of 2026-09-23; per WAFF the six-month moratorium remains in effect through 2026-12-15 (the council may extend it). On 2026-09-01 the council unanimously adopted permanent zoning rules making data centers and battery energy storage systems conditional uses in manufacturing/warehouse districts (Board of Zoning Adjustment review plus public hearing), but the moratorium was not ended. The adopted moratorium text and instrument number were not located. [VERIFY instrument number not confirmed at confidence 0.6 in the 2026-07 refresh]. Legal basis: City Council ordinance/resolution (instrument number not located).","severity_basis":null,"counties":["01049"],"evidence":[{"role":"compiled_source","url":"https://github.com/mjbommar/moratorium-data-2026/blob/main/data/moratorium_inventory.csv","access":null}]},
{"instrument_id":"nrel:wind:01003","state_code":"AL","jurisdiction_name":"Baldwin County","jurisdiction_type":"County","scope":"renewables_only","status":"unknown","severity_score":3,"technologies":["wind"],"restriction_types":["setback"],"evidence_level":"compiled_flagged","verification":"unverified","source_family":"NREL","date_enacted_iso":null,"date_text":"2014","current_end_date":null,"description":"Baldwin County wind siting ordinance, as compiled by NREL: noise limit 50 dBA; setback from structures (non-participating) 5 times tip height","severity_basis":"wind setback 5x height","counties":["01003"],"evidence":[{"role":"compiled_source","url":"https://doi.org/10.25984/3363758","access":null},{"role":"ordinance","url":"https://alison.legislature.state.al.us/files/pdf/SearchableInstruments/2014RS/PrintFiles/SB12-Eng.pdf","access":null}]},
